*.log
/tmp/

# Design record for this plugin's own development. Kept on disk, never shipped:
# `claude plugin install` copies every tracked file into the consumer's plugin
# directory, and a plan/spec pair is not runtime.
#
# Narrow on purpose. `/docs/superpowers/` as a whole would also swallow
# `docs/superpowers/coverage/`, which is where this plugin's own skills write their
# artifacts — dogfooding test-design on test-design would then produce a coverage doc and
# a verification report that silently could not be committed.
/docs/superpowers/plans/
/docs/superpowers/specs/
/docs/superpowers/waves/
/.superpowers/
/.claude/
# br doctor per-run artifacts
.doctor/

# `go build ./cmd/...` drops the verifier binary here; the isolation protocol
# hashes pre-existing untracked files.
/test-design-verifier
